    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d82-a1">

                <pb facs="0160" n="814" sameAs="frus:frus1875v02/pg814"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 1 in No.
                    239.—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Terashima to Mr. Bingham.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Foreign Office, Tokei</hi></placeName>,<lb/><date
                            calendar="japanese-nengō" when="1875-06-09"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >The</hi> 9<hi rendition="#italic">th of the</hi> 6<hi
                                rendition="#italic">th month of the</hi> 8<hi rendition="#italic">th
                                year of Meiji</hi></date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 29.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to notify your excellency
                    that the duties of the members of the daishinin, and of all courts, and the
                    regulations governing their proceedings, have been established as shown in the
                    accompanying printed pamphlet.</p>
                <p>They have been promulgated under the title of proclamation No. 91, and I have
                    much pleasure in transmitting them to you.</p>
                <p>With respect and consideration,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">terashima munenori</hi>,<lb/><hi
                            rendition="#italic">His Imperial Majesty’s Minister for Foreign
                            Affairs</hi>.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>His Excellency <hi rendition="#small-caps">John A. Bingham</hi>,<lb/><hi
                            rendition="#italic">Envoy Extraordinary and Minister Plenipotentiary of
                            the United States.</hi></p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
